{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_adr_0160_pull_requests_test_release_only_a_release_publishes_only_on_a_green_ci_gate_for_its_tag_and_packages_are_locked_adr_0160", "label": "ADR-0160", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0160-pull-requests-test-release-only-a-release-publishes-only-on-a-green-ci-gate-for-its-tag-and-packages-are-locked.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A pull request runs the Release tests only; release.yml publishes only after a success CI Gate check run on the tagged SHA; publishing is a separate write-scoped job that verifies checksums; vpk is pinned via dotnet-tools.json; every project commits packages.lock.json and restores in locked mode with win-x64;linux-x64 RuntimeIdentifiers \u2014 because what CI verified and what a release shipped were not the same thing."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0160_pull_requests_test_release_only_a_release_publishes_only_on_a_green_ci_gate_for_its_tag_and_packages_are_locked_ci_yml", "label": ".github/workflows/ci.yml", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0160-pull-requests-test-release-only-a-release-publishes-only-on-a-green-ci-gate-for-its-tag-and-packages-are-locked.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0160_pull_requests_test_release_only_a_release_publishes_only_on_a_green_ci_gate_for_its_tag_and_packages_are_locked_release_yml", "label": ".github/workflows/release.yml", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0160-pull-requests-test-release-only-a-release-publishes-only-on-a-green-ci-gate-for-its-tag-and-packages-are-locked.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0160_pull_requests_test_release_only_a_release_publishes_only_on_a_green_ci_gate_for_its_tag_and_packages_are_locked_ci_gate", "label": "CI Gate", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0160-pull-requests-test-release-only-a-release-publishes-only-on-a-green-ci-gate-for-its-tag-and-packages-are-locked.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Strict success check over all eight legs; a skipped step leaves its leg success, a failed/cancelled leg or run (if: always()) fails the gate."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0160_pull_requests_test_release_only_a_release_publishes_only_on_a_green_ci_gate_for_its_tag_and_packages_are_locked_pull_requests_run_release_tests_only", "label": "Pull Requests Run Release Tests Only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0160-pull-requests-test-release-only-a-release-publishes-only-on-a-green-ci-gate-for-its-tag-and-packages-are-locked.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "G-20: Debug and Release differ in very little the suite exercises; Debug test steps carry github.event_name != 'pull_request' per step (not per job, so job names and the gate's success check stay unchanged); a Debug-only failure is found on the push after merge."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0160_pull_requests_test_release_only_a_release_publishes_only_on_a_green_ci_gate_for_its_tag_and_packages_are_locked_release_publishes_only_on_green_ci_gate", "label": "A Release Publishes Only on a Green CI Gate for Its Tag", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0160-pull-requests-test-release-only-a-release-publishes-only-on-a-green-ci-gate-for-its-tag-and-packages-are-locked.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "G-21: release.yml and ci.yml ran in parallel on the tag; the ci-gate job now polls the Checks API (checks: read) for CI Gate runs on github.sha up to 75 minutes \u2014 polling, not workflow_run, because workflow_run runs the default branch's copy of the file and does not carry the tag."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0160_pull_requests_test_release_only_a_release_publishes_only_on_a_green_ci_gate_for_its_tag_and_packages_are_locked_write_scoped_publish_job", "label": "Publishing Is a Separate, Write-Scoped Job", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0160-pull-requests-test-release-only-a-release-publishes-only-on-a-green-ci-gate-for-its-tag-and-packages-are-locked.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "G-05: build runs contents: read with persist-credentials: false; publish (needs ci-gate and build) is the only job with contents: write, checks out nothing, verifies every checksum, and runs gh release create --verify-tag."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0160_pull_requests_test_release_only_a_release_publishes_only_on_a_green_ci_gate_for_its_tag_and_packages_are_locked_vpk_pinned", "label": "vpk Pinned via dotnet-tools.json", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0160-pull-requests-test-release-only-a-release-publishes-only-on-a-green-ci-gate-for-its-tag-and-packages-are-locked.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "G-07: package-installer.ps1 used whichever vpk was on PATH; now .config/dotnet-tools.json pins vpk 1.2.0 (rollForward false) equal to the Velopack package version and the script runs only dotnet tool restore + dotnet vpk pack."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0160_pull_requests_test_release_only_a_release_publishes_only_on_a_green_ci_gate_for_its_tag_and_packages_are_locked_nuget_packages_locked", "label": "NuGet Packages Locked", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0160-pull-requests-test-release-only-a-release-publishes-only-on-a-green-ci-gate-for-its-tag-and-packages-are-locked.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Floating transitive versions meant two runs of one commit could build different package sets; RestorePackagesWithLockFile in Directory.Build.props, committed packages.lock.json, --locked-mode in CI and RestoreLockedMode when CI=true; RuntimeIdentifiers win-x64;linux-x64 in every project so the -r win-x64 publish passes a locked restore (NU1004 otherwise)."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0160_pull_requests_test_release_only_a_release_publishes_only_on_a_green_ci_gate_for_its_tag_and_packages_are_locked_directory_build_props", "label": "Directory.Build.props", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0160-pull-requests-test-release-only-a-release-publishes-only-on-a-green-ci-gate-for-its-tag-and-packages-are-locked.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0160_pull_requests_test_release_only_a_release_publishes_only_on_a_green_ci_gate_for_its_tag_and_packages_are_locked_dotnet_tools_json", "label": ".config/dotnet-tools.json", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0160-pull-requests-test-release-only-a-release-publishes-only-on-a-green-ci-gate-for-its-tag-and-packages-are-locked.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0160_pull_requests_test_release_only_a_release_publishes_only_on_a_green_ci_gate_for_its_tag_and_packages_are_locked_package_installer_ps1", "label": "scripts/package-installer.ps1", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0160-pull-requests-test-release-only-a-release-publishes-only-on-a-green-ci-gate-for-its-tag-and-packages-are-locked.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0160_pull_requests_test_release_only_a_release_publishes_only_on_a_green_ci_gate_for_its_tag_and_packages_are_locked_nugetlockfiletests", "label": "NuGetLockFileTests", "file_type": "code", "